   "id": "gb-peak-district",
   "name": "Peak District classics",
   "region": "gb-midlands",
   "summary": "The weekend that most people's green laning starts with. A compact circuit of gritstone and limestone lanes around Eyam and Hathersage, close enough together that a day takes in half a dozen and short enough that nothing is committing.",
   "days": 1,
   "warning": "The most heavily TRO'd area in the country, and orders change often. Several famous Peak lanes are now closed to vehicles permanently.",
