   "name": "Yorkshire Dales byways",
   "region": "gb-north",
   "summary": "The best long-distance green laning in England. Roman road and drovers' track over the high limestone between Ribblehead and Wensleydale, miles at a time above the walls with the Three Peaks in view.",
