   "name": "North Wales and the Berwyn",
   "region": "gb-wales",
   "summary": "Steep, rocky and properly remote for somewhere this close to the border. The pass over the Berwyn between the Ceiriog and Dee valleys is the one people come for, with the Wayfarer memorial at the top of it.",
